Short description:
Website serves as a demowebshop for inspiration and testing needs. 
Used tools and test environment:
•	Windows 11 OS
•	Google Chrome (152.0.7977.84)
•	screen resoultion 1920x1080
•	tool: playwright

Test scope: adding item to cart, navigation, opening the product for more details, selecting clothing size and filtering products.

Test cases

Test case ID: TC-001
Description: As a user, I expect to be able to add a product to the cart.
Preconditions: User is on the Consumer goods page.
Steps:
1. Open the webpage https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en/webshop-eksempler/forbrugsvare. 
2. Click on the Add to Cart button.
Expected Result: The product is added to the cart, "Cauliflower (1pc) and is visible in the cart. 
Actual result: Test passed, the product was successfully added to the cart.


Test Case ID: TC-002
Description: As a user, I expect to be able to navigate to a product category from the homepage.
Preconditions: User is on the homepage.
Steps:
1. Open the webpage https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en .
2. From the main menu, click on "Men's clothing (shirts)".
Expected Result: The category page opens at the URL https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en/webshop-eksempler/webshop-med-herretoj .
Actual Result: Test passed, the category page opened at the expected URL.


Test Case ID: TC-003
Description: As a user, I expect to be able to open a specific product.
Preconditions: User is on the homepage.
Steps:
1. Open the webpage https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en .
2. From the main menu, click on "Men's clothing (shirts)".
3. Click on the product "Casual Men's Shirt 3541".
Expected Result: The product page opens at the URL https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en/products/mens-casual-shirt-3541 .
Actual Result: Test passed, the product page opened at the expected URL.


Test Case ID: TC-004
Description: As a user, I expect to be able to select a size for a product.
Preconditions: User is on the homepage.
Steps:
1. Open the webpage https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en .
2. From the main menu, click on "Men's clothing (shirts)".
3. Click on the product "Casual Men's Shirt 3541".
4. Select size "S" for the product.
Expected Result: The size "S" checkbox is checked.
Actual Result: Test passed, the size checkbox was successfully checked.


Test Case ID: TC-005
Description: As a user, I expect to be able to filter products by type on a category page.
Preconditions: User is on the Women's clothing - Demo 2 page.
Steps:
1. Open the webpage https://webshopdemo.concrete5.dk/en/webshop-eksempler/webshop-med-dametoj-demo-2 .
2. Click on the filter "Coat (1)".
Expected Result: The product list is filtered and shows the product "Casual Business".
Actual Result: Test passed, the filtered product "Casual Business" was displayed correctly.